.TH PERFECTSENSE 1 "2026-09-09" "PerfectSense 0.0.25" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
perfectsense \- one-shot CLI for Acer Predator PerfectSense sysfs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perfectsense
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.I command
[\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B perfectsense
is a
.B human
convenience tool for manual inspection and one-shot tweaks. It reads/writes
PerfectSense sysfs via
.BR libperfectsense .
Desktop UIs and automation should talk to
.B sysfs
or link
.B libperfectsense
directly — not shell out to this CLI.
It does
.B not
require
.BR perfectsensed (8)
for get/set (optional fan-curve timer and hotkey policy live in the daemon).
.PP
The kernel module
.B perfectsense.ko
must be loaded and must own the Acer gaming WMI path (unload conflicting
drivers such as
.B nekro_sense
/
.B acer\-wmi
first). Prefer
.B /usr/bin/perfectsense
if a Pandora shim shadows the name on
.BR PATH .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit machine-readable JSON for commands that support it (notably
.BR status ).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B color status|srgb|native|apply \fR[\fB\-\-profile edid\fR|\fIICC\fR]
Internal panel gamut. A wide\-gamut panel shows sRGB content oversaturated;
.B srgb
asks the running compositor to map untagged sRGB into the panel's
characterization (its EDID primaries, or an ICC file), and
.B native
turns the mapping off. Only the compositor can do the conversion, so the
choice goes to it: Umbriel through the include
.IR ~/.config/umbriel/perfect\-sense\-color.toml ,
sway through
.BR swaymsg ,
KDE through
.BR kscreen\-doctor ;
other compositors get the generated ICC file to load by hand. The choice is
kept in
.I ~/.config/perfect\-sense/color.conf
and
.B apply
re\-applies it.
.TP
.B status
Print thermal profile, AC, fans, temps/RPM, battery/misc, RGB/logo summary.
.TP
.B temps
Print CPU/GPU temperatures in °C (hwmon name
.BR perfectsense ).
.TP
.B gpu powerd get|on|off
Query or force
.B nvidia\-powerd
(Dynamic Boost ~80 W↔~140 W). Normally driven by
.B mode set
(off for eco/quiet; on for balanced+).
.TP
.B gpu powermizer get|set \fR...
Best-effort NVIDIA PowerMizer Preferred Mode (often does not stick on Wayland).
.TP
.BI "mode get" \fR "|" " mode set " name
Get or set the firmware thermal profile.
Also syncs
.B nvidia\-powerd
on Helios and applies matching userspace CPU governor / EPP
(low\-power→power, quiet→balance_power, balanced→balance_performance,
balanced\-performance and performance→governor performance + EPP performance).
Names:
.BR low\-power ,
.BR quiet ,
.BR balanced ,
.BR balanced\-performance ,
.BR performance .
Aliases:
.BR eco ,
.BR turbo ,
.BR bp .
.TP
.BI "fan get" \fR "|" " fan set " "cpu gpu" \fR "|" " fan auto"
Read duty/RPM or set target duties (percent), or return fans to firmware auto.
Note: on this EC,
.B fan_duty
in firmware-auto often echoes the last custom command, not live PWM — prefer
.B fan_rpm
and temps for observation.
.TP
.BI "fan curve on" \fR "|" " off" \fR "|" " status" \fR "|" " reload" \fR "|" " set " key=val…
Custom userspace fan curve, applied by
.B perfectsensed
when enabled.
Each axis (CPU / GPU) has bands
.BI ( temp_lo , temp_hi , duty% )
meaning: while that sensor is between
.I temp_lo
and
.I temp_hi ,
that fan runs at
.IR duty% .
Gaps between bands are linearly interpolated; below the lowest band duty is 0;
above the highest band the last duty is held.
.B set
keys:
.BI cpu= "'(90,100,95),(85,89,90)'" ,
.BI gpu= "…" ,
.BI interval_ms= N .
Quote values that contain parentheses/commas.
Manual
.B fan set
pauses the curve until targets return to auto / curve-owned values.
.TP
.B battery get|on|off
80% charge limiter.
.TP
.B battery calibration get|on|off
OEM battery calibration bit.
.TP
.BI "usb get" \fR "|" " usb set " minutes
USB charging while powered off (0 / 10 / 20 / 30).
.TP
.BI "lcd get" \fR "|" " lcd set " 0|1
LCD override.
.TP
.BI "kb\-timeout get" \fR "|" " kb\-timeout set " 0|1
Keyboard backlight timeout (~30 s).
.TP
.BI "boot\-sound get" \fR "|" " boot\-sound set " 0|1
Boot animation sound.
.TP
.B rgb \fR...
Four-zone keyboard colours and effects; see
.BR help .
.TP
.B logo \fR...
Lid logo colour / enable.
.TP
.B lights reset
Lighting controller reset.
.TP
.BI "event inject " name
Synthetic hotkey for daemon testing.
.TP
.B cpu \fR...
Userspace CPU power (governor, EPP, turbo, RAPL) and named presets.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /sys/devices/platform/perfectsense/perfect_sense/
Primary sysfs ABI.
.TP
.I /etc/perfectsense/fan\-curve.conf
Persisted fan curve (when writable).
.TP
.I /run/perfectsense/fan\-curve.conf
Runtime override for the curve.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR perfectsensed (8)
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/yPerfectBR/PerfectSense
